# Keep local env OUT of the Vercel build so the public showcase deploys in DEMO
# mode (no VITE_ vars → mock data, auth bypassed, fully clickable). To deploy a
# real/live build instead, set VITE_SUPABASE_URL + VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY
# in the Vercel project's Environment Variables (not via an uploaded .env file).
.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.production
.env.*.local
